            <itunes:summary><![CDATA[Get to know nurse and diabetes educator James Fain, associate dean for academic affairs at the Graduate School of Nursing at the University of Massachusetts Medical School in Worcester, Mass. Fain is also editor-in-chief of The Diabetes Educator. On Nursing Notes Live this month we examine how nurses help manage patients with chronic illnesses. In this episode of the Nursing Notes Live podcast, I got the chance to sit down and interview Jim. Here’s that interview.<br />
—-<br />
Subscribe to the MP3 Audio Podcast<br />
