            <itunes:summary><![CDATA[<a href="https://www.amsn.org"></a>The focus is on medical-surgical nursing in this episode of the Nursing Notes Live podcast with a panel discussion on our topic. On the panel is Jill Arzouman, President of the Academy of Medical-Surgical Nurses and a clinical nurse specialist at Banner University Medical Center in Tucson, Arizona. Also joining us is Mimi Haskins, president of the Medical-Surgical Nurse Certification Board and a clinical assistant professor at the State University of New York School of Nursing in Buffalo, New York. Here’s that discussion.<br />
—-<br />
