            <description>&lt;p&gt;Hear how nurses are giving back to their communities, and to the world. In this episode of Nursing Notes Live, you’ll meet a nurse and a physician’s assistant involved with the Nursing Innovation Council of Excellence Employee Resource Group (NICE ERG) at Johnson &amp; Johnson, and hear about their recent visit to Nicaragua. We talk...&lt;/p&gt;
