            <description>&lt;p&gt;Get to know Regina Wysocki, a school nurse and an alumna of the Johnson &amp; Johnson School Health Leadership Program. Regina’s also the author of the 21st Century Nurse blog. Hear what she has to say about cultural awareness in nursing, and listen to questions from nursing students, as part of our “Ask A Nurse”...&lt;/p&gt;
