            <itunes:summary><![CDATA[Get to know nurse Captain Estacy Porter, the public health nurse officer in charge at the 14th Combat Support Hospital in Fort Benning, Georgia. Hear about Captain Porter’s military career in nursing and questions from nursing students, as part of our “Ask A Nurse” portion of the podcast.<br />
