            <guid isPermaLink="false">http://nursingnoteslive.com/?p=378</guid>
            <description>&lt;p&gt;Meet our Get to Know Nurse Elizabeth Voyles, Nurse Coordinator of Palliative Care at Children’s Hospital of Michigan. I ask Elizabeth about her career in pediatric nursing and also shared questions from current nursing students, as part of our first “Ask A Nurse” portion of the podcast. MP3 Audio Podcast  Facebook —- Jamie Davis:         Beth, welcome...&lt;/p&gt;
