            <description>&lt;p&gt;Check out how nurses use social media and technology in their nursing practice. I got the chance to sit down and chat with our distinguished nursing panel including Pamela Cipriano, Research Associate Professor at the University of Virginia School of Nursing and Meredith Rowe, nursing professor and endowed chair at the University of South Florida...&lt;/p&gt;
