            <description>&lt;p&gt;Meet Jan Revella, an arthritis specialist and the Director of Research and Education at the Sonoran Spine Center in Phoenix, Arizona. Here’s what she has to say about being a rheumatology nurse. —- MP3 Audio Podcast  Facebook —- Jamie Davis:         Jan, welcome Nursing Notes Live. It’s great to have you on the show here. I...&lt;/p&gt;
