            <description>&lt;p&gt;We’re taking a look at the nurses working in retail and urgent care clinics around the country. These locations are changing the face of healthcare and how it’s managed. Hear what Dodi Iannaco, a nurse practitioner at Virtua Express Urgent Care in New Jersey, and Angela Patterson, Chief Nurse Practitioner Officer at CVS Minute Clinic...&lt;/p&gt;
