            <pubDate>Mon, 01 Apr 2013 14:46:42 +0000</pubDate>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">http://nursingnoteslive.com/?p=235</guid>
            <description>&lt;p&gt;  Get to know nurse Lynda Stallwood, and hear about her nursing career and her important work with patients living with diabetes. —- MP3 Audio Podcast  Facebook —- Jamie Davis:         Lynda, let’s start off with asking you how you decided to become a nurse. What encouraged you that nursing was a career you wanted to...&lt;/p&gt;
