            <title>Get to Know Nurse Mary Anne Kenyon and Orthopaedic Nursing</title>
            <link>http://nursingnoteslive.com/2011/10/get-to-know-nurse-mary-anne-kenyon-and-orthopaedic-nursing/</link>
            <pubDate>Sat, 29 Oct 2011 12:57:16 +0000</pubDate>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">http://nursingnoteslive.com/?p=165</guid>
            <description>&lt;p&gt;This month marks the one year anniversary of Nursing Notes Live! In this month’s episode, Nursing Notes Live takes a look at the world of orthopaedic nursing. This month’s featured “Get to Know Nurse” is Mary Anne Kenyon, Nursing Director for Orthopaedics at Brigham &amp; Women’s Hospital in Boston, Massachusetts. I asked Mary Anne how...&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The post &lt;a rel="nofollow" href="http://nursingnoteslive.com/2011/10/get-to-know-nurse-mary-anne-kenyon-and-orthopaedic-nursing/"&gt;Get to Know Nurse Mary Anne Kenyon and Orthopaedic Nursing&lt;/a&gt; appeared first on &lt;a rel="nofollow" href="http://nursingnoteslive.com"&gt;Johnson &amp; Johnson Notes on Nursing Live&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
