            <title>Pain Management Nurse Esther Bernhofer Shares Her Nursing Career Path</title>
            <link>http://nursingnoteslive.com/2011/09/pain-management-nurse-esther-bernhofer-shares-her-nursing-career-path/</link>
            <pubDate>Thu, 29 Sep 2011 12:34:54 +0000</pubDate>
