            <description>&lt;p&gt;Nursing Notes Live delves into the world of the pain management nurse. This month’s featured “Get to Know Nurse” Esther Bernhofer is a Pain Research Nurse at the Nursing Institute of Medicine and Digestive Inpatient Cleveland Clinic. I asked her how she decided to become a nurse and what drew her to focus on the...&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The post &lt;a rel="nofollow" href="http://nursingnoteslive.com/2011/09/pain-management-nurse-esther-bernhofer-shares-her-nursing-career-path/"&gt;Pain Management Nurse Esther Bernhofer Shares Her Nursing Career Path&lt;/a&gt; appeared first on &lt;a rel="nofollow" href="http://nursingnoteslive.com"&gt;Johnson &amp; Johnson Notes on Nursing Live&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
