            <description>&lt;p&gt;This month’s Featured “Get to Know Nurse” Sheila Caldwell, took her background in hospital patient care and case management into the school setting as a school nurse in New Jersey. I asked her how she decided to become a nurse and how she became interested in caring for an entire school’s student population. —- MP3...&lt;/p&gt;
