            <itunes:summary><![CDATA[<a href="http://www.aana.com/"></a>In this month’s episodes, Nursing Notes Live will look into the nursing specialty of the nurse anesthetist. I got the chance to chat with several of these advanced practice nurse specialists in our panel segment this month. Joining me are former American Association of Nurse Anesthetists President Terry Wicks, Nickie Damico, assistant professor and director of professional practice at the Virginia Commonwealth University Department of Nurse Anesthesia in Richmond, Virginia, and Timothy Holt Smith, a CRNA at Johns Hopkins Bayview Medical Center in Baltimore, Maryland.<br />
