            <itunes:summary><![CDATA[Delve in to the world of the clinical nurse specialist. In this episode we brought together a panel of clinical nurse specialists from around the country to talk about this advanced practice nursing path. Joining us today are Martha Gurzick, Clinical Nurse Specialist in Pediatrics at Frederick Memorial Hospital in Maryland, Ann Mayo, Professor at the University of San Diego Hahn School of Nursing and Health Science, and Peggy Wellman a Nurse Manager at CDH Proton Center in Illinois.<br />
